{"en": "1439432709", "title": "Admin : Configurer les informations du site", "adf": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Guide pratique · Administrateurs", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "En bref"}]}, {"type": "table", "attrs": {"layout": "default", "width": 760.0}, "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Objectif"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Consulter et définir les propriétés du site qui identifient votre laboratoire et contrôlent le comportement de l'ensemble du site."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Résultat obtenu"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Des paramètres du site mis à jour et appliqués dans tout OpenELIS (libellés, préfixes, activation de fonctionnalités)."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Qui s'en charge"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Administrateurs. L'accès dépend des droits de l'utilisateur et peut être configuré par votre administrateur."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Avant de commencer"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "La valeur exacte à définir. Certaines propriétés (URL de services externes, identifiants de connexion) doivent être coordonnées avec votre équipe technique."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Où"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Menu principal → Administration → Configurations générales → Informations sur le site."}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Informations sur le site est un tableau de propriétés nommées, chacune avec une Description et une Valeur. Il couvre l'identité du site (préfixe du numéro de laboratoire, libellés d'adresse et d'unités géographiques, titre de la bannière), les options d'affichage (horloge sur 24 heures, changement de langue) et l'activation de fonctionnalités (signatures électroniques, source externe de patients)."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Étape 1 : Trouver la propriété"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ouvrez "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Main Menu", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " et cliquez sur "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Administration", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Admin", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ")"}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 951, "alt": "Admin August.png", "id": "4d6d37fc-d085-45a8-a426-299d068b93d6", "collection": "contentId-1439432709", "type": "file", "height": 371}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Administration", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 2}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquez sur "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Configurations générales", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "General Configurations", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ")."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 945, "alt": "gen config.png", "id": "fe3cd735-17bd-4b4c-9478-70d7801a891b", "collection": "contentId-1439432709", "type": "file", "height": 359}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Configurations générales", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 3}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquez sur "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Informations sur le site", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Site Information", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ")."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 959, "alt": "site info.png", "id": "430e4f80-b3c5-443e-98ab-4df63c9532e9", "collection": "contentId-1439432709", "type": "file", "height": 370}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Informations sur le site", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "info"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "La liste indique pour chaque propriété son "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Nom", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Name", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "), sa "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Description", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " et sa "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Valeur", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Value", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") actuelle. Faites défiler jusqu'à la propriété voulue."}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "align-start", "width": 1020, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 2894, "id": "e72b9cf0-54b1-4d83-865c-435e90f1e892", "collection": "contentId-1439432709", "type": "file", "height": 6950}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Le tableau des propriétés Informations sur le site : Nom, Description et Valeur de chaque paramètre du site.", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph"}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Étape 2 : Modifier une valeur"}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 1}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cochez le bouton radio "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Sélectionner", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Select", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") de la propriété, puis cliquez sur "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Modifier", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "Modify", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ")."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 959, "alt": "mod site.png", "id": "4e3e3407-e300-4257-bf74-a25514247112", "collection": "contentId-1439432709", "type": "file", "height": 392}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cliquez sur Modifier", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "orderedList", "attrs": {"order": 2}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Saisissez la nouvelle "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Valeur", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " et enregistrez."}]}]}]}, {"type": "mediaSingle", "attrs": {"layout": "center", "width": 760, "widthType": "pixel"}, "content": [{"type": "media", "attrs": {"width": 953, "alt": "true save.png", "id": "0ed8587e-0372-4aad-b642-a9c9f748a37b", "collection": "contentId-1439432709", "type": "file", "height": 368}}, {"type": "caption", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Modifier & enregistrer", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph"}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Description des champs (propriétés choisies)"}]}, {"type": "table", "attrs": {"layout": "default", "width": 760.0}, "content": [{"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Propriété"}]}]}, {"type": "tableHeader", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Remarques"}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Accession number prefix"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Préfixe des numéros de laboratoire du site (par ex., DEV01) ; ne peut plus être modifié une fois que des échantillons existent."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "electronicSignatureEnabled"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Active les signatures électroniques 21 CFR Part 11 pour la saisie et la validation des résultats."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "esigSessionTimeoutMinutes"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Délai d'inactivité de la session de signature (30 par défaut)."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "bannerHeading"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Le texte de la bannière de l'application ; accepte des valeurs par langue (par ex., anglais / français)."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "allowLanguageChange"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Permet aux utilisateurs de changer de langue à la connexion."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Address / Geographic Unit labels"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Renomme les lignes d'adresse et les unités géographiques (par ex., Région, District) selon les termes locaux."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "useExternalPatientSource"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Importe les données démographiques des patients depuis une source externe."}]}]}]}, {"type": "tableRow", "content": [{"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "TrainingInstallation"}]}]}, {"type": "tableCell", "attrs": {"colspan": 1, "rowspan": 1}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Marque l'instance comme installation de formation, ce qui permet la suppression de toutes les données des patients et des échantillons. À utiliser avec une extrême prudence."}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Remarques"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "content": [{"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "TrainingInstallation", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " permet la suppression irréversible de toutes les données des patients et des échantillons ; ne l'activez que sur une instance de formation."}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Certaines valeurs (URL de services, identifiants de connexion) nécessitent une coordination technique et peuvent exiger un redémarrage pour prendre pleinement effet."}]}]}]}], "version": 1}}